@startuml
skinparam classAttributeIconSize 0

class Student {
    - studentId : String
    - name : String
    - email : String
    --
    + viewAvailability() : void
    + bookRoom(room : Room, start : DateTime, end : DateTime) : Booking
    + cancelBooking(booking : Booking) : void
}

class Room {
    - roomId : String
    - name : String
    - blocked : Boolean
    --
    + isAvailable(start : DateTime, end : DateTime) : Boolean
    + block() : void
    + unblock() : void
}

class Booking {
    - bookingId : String
    - startTime : DateTime
    - endTime : DateTime
    - status : String
    --
    + cancel() : void
}

Student "1" -- "0..*" Booking : makes
Room "1" -- "0..*" Booking : has

note right of Booking
Rules:
R1: booking starts in the future,
    duration > 0 and <= 2 hours
R2: active bookings for the same room
    cannot overlap
R3: a blocked room cannot accept
    a new booking
R4: a successful booking produces
    a confirmation
end note

note bottom
Assumptions:
1. Each Booking belongs to exactly one Student.
2. Each Booking reserves exactly one Room.
3. Touching bookings such as 10:00–12:00
   and 12:00–13:00 do not overlap.
4. Blocking a room does not cancel or modify
   existing bookings.
5. Administrator remains an actor and is not
   modeled as a domain class.
6. Confirmation is system behavior, not a
   separate domain class.
end note

@enduml
